WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.185
"I caught a minnow!" Jeremy said.

2
00:00:05.186 --> 00:00:10.626
He started to pull in his line.

3
00:00:10.627 --> 00:00:13.520
But the hook was stuck on something!

4
00:00:13.521 --> 00:00:19.101
The farmer was across the pond.

5
00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:22.057
Suddenly his line jerked.

6
00:00:22.058 --> 00:00:25.050
"A fish!" the farmer said.

7
00:00:25.051 --> 00:00:34.081
He pulled in his line.

8
00:00:34.082 --> 00:00:39.514
"Ahh!" Jeremy's rod flew into the air.

9
00:00:39.515 --> 00:00:41.626
Jeremy flew with it.

10
00:00:41.627 --> 00:00:45.212
"I didn't catch a minnow," Jeremy said.

11
00:00:45.213 --> 00:00:48.371
"I caught a farmer!"

12
00:00:48.372 --> 00:00:51.382
Jeremy let go of his fishing rod.

13
00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:55.793
He fell down, down, down.

14
00:00:55.794 --> 00:00:58.266
Plop!

15
00:00:58.267 --> 00:01:03.131
Jeremy landed in the farmer's pail.

16
00:01:03.132 --> 00:01:07.996
"Oh no!" Jeremy thought.

17
00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:11.239
He sat very still.

18
00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:13.642
The farmer looked at his line.

19
00:01:13.643 --> 00:01:15.461
"Huh," he said.

20
00:01:15.462 --> 00:01:17.492
"I did not catch a fish.

21
00:01:17.493 --> 00:01:20.178
I caught a hook!"

22
00:01:20.179 --> 00:01:23.143
Jeremy didn't move.

23
00:01:23.144 --> 00:01:27.351
"The farmer must not see me!" he thought.

24
00:01:27.352 --> 00:01:30.423
But Jeremy had another problem.

25
00:01:30.424 --> 00:01:42.307
He was trapped in the pail!

